{"id":"vod_hh_119389","vodId":"119389","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"打工吧！魔王大人","name_cn":"打工吧！魔王大人","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/d3e632e0af5200fc0e75485fb6db422f.jpg"},"summary":"在平行空间的圣十字大陆上，邪恶魔王撒旦（逢坂良太 配音）派出魔军侵略周围的领土。人类在勇士艾米利亚（日笠阳子 配音）的率领下奋起反抗，最终攻入魔宫，迫使撒旦逃离此地。当魔王恢复意识后，发现自己竟然和忠实随从阿尔谢奈尔（小野友树 配音）置身于完全陌生的地球日本东京。魔力全失的二人为了生计不得不领取社保卡、银行卡等必须要件，还要每日外出打工维持吃穿用度。时时刻刻渴望回归本土的魔王，某天意外发现艾米利亚竟然也追踪自己来到地球！虽然衣食住行令人烦恼，但是这三个看似中二病缠身的年轻人渐渐习惯了地球的生活。与此同时，仿佛有另一股力量潜伏在他们身边，时刻准备抹杀魔王和勇者的存在……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-01-26 12:30:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYYOX6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYYOX1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aOYY1qgd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPP1JVb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQWW3gqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejRRGOWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwppYZJe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYYKXla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b822wWle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYYKXJa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM88YNQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ66lrEe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkkQBwa/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:00.766Z"}